    "beamjoy.window.config.tabs.core.legacyImport.infected.tooltip": "Scans BeamJoyData/db/scenarii for old BeamJoy Free Infected arenas (the same <map>_hunter.json files Hunter's own import uses; copy that folder in first) and imports every map found at once.",
